    <!-- Legal content -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">RateFlip Privacy Policy

Last updated: April 7, 2026

1. Information We Collect
RateFlip does not collect any personal information. The app only stores your preferences locally on your device.

2. Exchange Rate Data
We obtain exchange rate data from third-party APIs. We do not guarantee the accuracy of third-party exchange rate data.

3. Local Storage
Your settings are stored locally using SharedPreferences. No data is transmitted to our servers.

4. Advertisements
We display advertisements through Google AdMob. Google may collect and use data for ad personalization.

5. Contact Us
For questions about this privacy policy, please contact: support@rateflip.com</string>
